{"sha": "03f8b8badf4841e4a7938f108f1148822f63245ec1f5d163fa5583cddb089740", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:kinematics-2d} 章 --- 二维运动学}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:1}", "$\\vect v = (3.0, 4.0)$，恒定；速率 $\\sqrt{3.0^2 + 4.0^2} =", "\\qty{5.0}{m/s}$。轨迹为直线 $y = \\tfrac43 x$。", "速度矢量恒定：匀速直线运动。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:2}", "直线，间距相等：匀速直线运动；", "$v = 0.35/0.10 = \\qty{3.5}{m/s}$。若间距逐渐增大，", "则说明速率在增大。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:3}", "$v(t) = 4.0\\,t$，$a = \\qty{4.0}{m/s^2}$：加速度恒定，", "匀加速直线运动。$v(3.0) = \\qty{12}{m/s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:4}", "$f = 1/8.0 = \\qty{0.125}{Hz}$;", "$v = 2\\pi \\times 4.5/8.0 \\approx \\qty{3.5}{m/s}$;", "$a = v^2/R = 3.53^2/4.5 \\approx \\qty{2.8}{m/s^2}$，指向", "旋转木马的中心轴。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:5}", "斜率：$a = (10.0 - 2.0)/4.0 = \\qty{2.0}{m/s^2}$。面积（梯形）：", "$d = \\tfrac12 (2.0 + 10.0) \\times 4.0 = \\qty{24}{m}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:6}", "$v = \\qty{88.9}{m/s}$: $a_n = 88.9^2/6000 \\approx \\qty{1.3}{m/s^2}", "\\approx 0.13\\,g$。由 $a_n = v^2/R$ 可知，$v$ 越大，所需 $R$ 越大，", "才能使侧向加速度（以及轨道和乘客所受的力）保持在可接受范围内 ---", "弯道倾斜改变的是由谁提供这一加速度，", "而不改变其大小。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:7}", "$v(t) = -2.4\\,t + 8.0$；$a = \\qty{-2.4}{m/s^2}$，加速度恒定。换向", "在 $v = 0$ 时，$t = 8.0/2.4 \\approx \\qty{3.3}{s}$，", "位于 $x \\approx \\qty{16.3}{m}$ 处。之前：沿正向，减速；之后：沿负向，", "速率增大 --- 全程匀加速。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:8}", "$v_1 = 0.28/0.40 = \\qty{0.70}{m/s}$;", "$v_2 = (0.54 - 0.10)/0.40 = \\qty{1.10}{m/s}$;", "$v_3 = (0.88 - 0.28)/0.40 = \\qty{1.50}{m/s}$。速度每", "经过 \\qty{0.20}{s} 即增加 \\qty{0.40}{m/s}，$a = \\qty{2.0}{m/s^2}$，加速度恒定", "--- 匀加速直线运动。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:9}", "$T = \\qty{2.36e6}{s}$: $v = 2\\pi \\times \\num{3.84e8}/\\num{2.36e6}", "\\approx \\qty{1.0e3}{m/s}$;", "$a_n = v^2/R \\approx \\qty{2.7e-3}{m/s^2}$。比值：", "$g/a_n \\approx 3600 = 60^2$ --- 万有引力随距离的", "平方成反比减弱（见\\cref{ch:g10:universal-gravitation}），正好", "解释了月球的绕转。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:10}", "$f = 1200/60 = \\qty{20}{Hz}$, $T = \\qty{0.050}{s}$;", "$v = 2\\pi R f = 2\\pi \\times 0.25 \\times 20 \\approx \\qty{31}{m/s}$;", "$a_n = v^2/R \\approx \\qty{3.9e3}{m/s^2} \\approx 400\\,g$。滚筒", "壁提供衣物所需的 $a_n$；经小孔时，没有任何东西", "把水向内推，因此水沿切线方向飞出。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:11}", "$v_0 = \\qty{25}{m/s}$: $t_s = 25/7.5 \\approx \\qty{3.3}{s}$;", "$d = v_0^2/(2a) = 625/15 \\approx \\qty{42}{m}$。图像为", "一条直线段，自 \\qty{25}{m/s} 降至 $0$，时刻为 $t_s$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:12}", "$\\vect v = (-R\\omega\\sin\\omega t,\\, R\\omega\\cos\\omega t)$，其", "模恒为 $R\\omega$；它与 $\\vect{OM}$ 的点积为零，", "故与半径垂直，即沿切线方向。再次求导，", "得 $\\vect a = -\\omega^2\\vect{OM}$：指向 $O$，模为", "$\\omega^2 R = (v/R)^2 R = v^2/R$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:13}", "$a_t = \\qty{2.5}{m/s^2}$（沿反方向），$a_n = 20^2/80 =", "\\qty{5.0}{m/s^2}$;", "$a = \\sqrt{2.5^2 + 5.0^2} \\approx \\qty{5.6}{m/s^2}$；与运动方向的", "夹角：$\\theta = 180^\\circ - \\arctan(5.0/2.5) \\approx 117^\\circ$", "（即与正后方的夹角为 $63^\\circ$）。$5.6 < 7.0$：在抓地力", "范围内，余量不大。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:14}", "起动阶段：$t_1 = 20/1.2 \\approx \\qty{17}{s}$，", "$d_1 = 20^2/(2 \\times 1.2) \\approx \\qty{167}{m}$。匀速行驶：", "\\qty{40}{s}，$\\qty{800}{m}$。制动阶段：$t_3 = 20/1.5 \\approx", "\\qty{13}{s}$，$d_3 = 400/3.0 \\approx \\qty{133}{m}$。总计：", "$\\qty{1.1e3}{m}$，用时 \\qty{70}{s}；平均速率 $1100/70 \\approx", "\\qty{16}{m/s}$（\\qty{57}{km/h}）。$v(t)$ 图像为梯形，其面积", "$\\tfrac12(70 + 40) \\times 20 = \\qty{1100}{m}$，与总路程相符。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:kinematics-2d:15}", "$v = 2\\pi \\times \\num{4.22e7}/\\num{86164} \\approx \\qty{3.1e3}{m/s}$;", "$a_n = v^2/R \\approx \\qty{0.22}{m/s^2}$。地球在该距离处的", "引力提供了它；周期与地球的自转周期相等，因此", "卫星与地面同步转动，始终悬停在赤道上空的", "同一点（见\\cref{ch:g12:satellites-kepler}）。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}